## 4. Required review gate

A fresh full atomic independent reviewer must verify all R4 bound bytes and
offline commands, then independently test the real inherited dataclass scanner
load, digest-before-execution behavior, collision preservation, module identity
substitution cleanup, and no residual module mapping. The reviewer must not
invoke `--actual` or any Host path.

## 5. Jenn decision surface

### A. Do not execute yet

Keep R4 at its fresh independent-review gate. No VCPToolBox Git command,
temporary root, receipt, scanner execution in actual mode, Host operation, or
runtime path may occur.

### B. Future decision only after review and freeze

A new separate Jenn execution decision may exist only after R4 receives a
fresh independent `PASS_NO_BLOCKER` review and is separately accepted/frozen.
It must bind the R4 manifest, independent review, freeze decision and exact
R4 runner SHA-256. It cannot be inferred from this draft.
